{
  "transcript": {
    "duration": 251.86,
    "segments": [
      {
        "id": 0,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 0.0,
        "end": 3.05,
        "text": "ji bataye kya chahiye?"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 4.2,
        "end": 8.05,
        "text": "laptop ke liye taar wala u s bee mouse chahiye-saadharan sa."
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 9.0,
        "end": 14.250000000000002,
        "text": "ji ye wala hai, do button hai aur beech mein scroll wheel hai."
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 15.150000000000002,
        "end": 15.900000000000002,
        "text": "kitne ka hai?"
      },
      {
        "id": 4,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 18.05,
        "end": 21.85,
        "text": "teen sau ninyanve rupaye ka hai, tax milakar."
      },
      {
        "id": 5,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 22.700000000000003,
        "end": 25.250000000000004,
        "text": "theek hai, ek baar chala kar dikha denge?"
      },
      {
        "id": 6,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 26.314,
        "end": 33.864000000000004,
        "text": "khan ji, is laptop mein laga deta hoon. lijiye, aap click aur scroll karke dekh lein."
      },
      {
        "id": 7,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 35.114000000000004,
        "end": 38.314,
        "text": "haan, sahi chal raha hai, yahin de dijiye."
      },
      {
        "id": 8,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 39.014,
        "end": 44.664,
        "text": "ji, isi ko wapas dibbe mein rakh deta hoon. bill kis naam se banao?"
      },
      {
        "id": 9,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 45.464,
        "end": 46.964,
        "text": "amit kumar ke naam se."
      },
      {
        "id": 10,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 47.814,
        "end": 49.314,
        "text": "bhuktaan upi se kar doon?"
      },
      {
        "id": 11,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 49.763999999999996,
        "end": 52.864000000000004,
        "text": "ji, saamne wala qr scan kar lijiye."
      },
      {
        "id": 12,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 54.047999999999995,
        "end": 55.698,
        "text": "تین سو ننانوے روپے"
      },
      {
        "id": 13,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 56.547999999999995,
        "end": 58.797999999999995,
        "text": "kar diya. ye dekhiye."
      },
      {
        "id": 14,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 59.297999999999995,
        "end": 64.198,
        "text": "جی بھگت آ گیا یہ آپ کا ماؤس اور بل"
      },
      {
        "id": 15,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 66.898,
        "end": 68.398,
        "text": "theek hai dhanyavaad."
      },
      {
        "id": 16,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 80.5,
        "end": 82.3,
        "text": "What are you looking for to day?"
      },
      {
        "id": 17,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 83.9,
        "end": 90.35,
        "text": "A phone under fifteen thousand, mainly calls, whatsapp and videos; batteries should be good."
      },
      {
        "id": 18,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 91.2,
        "end": 102.5,
        "text": "This one is thirteen thousand nine hundred ninety nine, it has a five thousand m a h battery and one hundred twenty eight gigabyte storage. The demo piece is here."
      },
      {
        "id": 19,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 103.8,
        "end": 104.1,
        "text": "Okay."
      },
      {
        "id": 20,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 104.692,
        "end": 108.592,
        "text": "Anything else good-another phone in the same budget, I mean?"
      },
      {
        "id": 21,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 109.342,
        "end": 120.142,
        "text": "Yes; this model here is also thirteen thousand nine hundred ninety nine; same battery capacity and storage, but the screen is slightly smaller."
      },
      {
        "id": 22,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 120.99199999999999,
        "end": 126.49199999999999,
        "text": "Smaller is fine; my current phone barely fits in my pocket-how is the camera?"
      },
      {
        "id": 23,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 127.292,
        "end": 135.04,
        "text": "Decent for daytime photos; indoors you will see some grain. You can take a photo on the demo and check."
      },
      {
        "id": 24,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 135.84,
        "end": 140.74,
        "text": "Can you open the same video on both? I want to compare the screens."
      },
      {
        "id": 25,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 142.49,
        "end": 143.04,
        "text": "Sure,"
      },
      {
        "id": 26,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 143.84,
        "end": 147.59,
        "text": "same video, and I have put both at the same brightness."
      },
      {
        "id": 27,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 148.44,
        "end": 149.04000000000002,
        "text": "Here you go."
      },
      {
        "id": 28,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 149.79000000000002,
        "end": 153.94,
        "text": "The smaller one looks fine to me. Is the black color available?"
      },
      {
        "id": 29,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 155.086,
        "end": 161.036,
        "text": "Yes, we have a sealed black piece-this same one hundred twenty eight gigabyte version."
      },
      {
        "id": 30,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 162.036,
        "end": 168.38600000000002,
        "text": "I'll take that! Thirteen thousand nine hundred ninety nine rupee is the final amount, including g s t"
      },
      {
        "id": 31,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 169.186,
        "end": 173.73600000000002,
        "text": "Yes, including g s t Shall I make the bill in your name?"
      },
      {
        "id": 32,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 174.38600000000002,
        "end": 177.48600000000002,
        "text": "Yes, please! I'll give you the details."
      },
      {
        "id": 33,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 186.21800000000002,
        "end": 188.768,
        "text": "Good evening! What are you looking for?"
      },
      {
        "id": 34,
        "speaker": "D",
        "start": 189.918,
        "end": 194.11800000000002,
        "text": "I need a two meter hdmi cable to connect my laptop to the t v"
      },
      {
        "id": 35,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 196.918,
        "end": 201.068,
        "text": "Sure! Your laptop has the regular hdmi port, correct?"
      },
      {
        "id": 36,
        "speaker": "D",
        "start": 201.918,
        "end": 205.21800000000002,
        "text": "Yes, the regular one I checked before coming"
      },
      {
        "id": 37,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 205.96800000000002,
        "end": 212.068,
        "text": "Here you go. This is a two meter hdmi cable. It's three hundred ninety nine."
      },
      {
        "id": 38,
        "speaker": "D",
        "start": 214.062,
        "end": 216.762,
        "text": "Is that the final price, including g s t?"
      },
      {
        "id": 39,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 217.912,
        "end": 222.662,
        "text": "Yes; three hundred ninety nine rupees, including g s t"
      },
      {
        "id": 40,
        "speaker": "D",
        "start": 223.412,
        "end": 226.46200000000002,
        "text": "Okay, I'll take this. Can I pay by u p i?"
      },
      {
        "id": 41,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 227.61200000000002,
        "end": 231.812,
        "text": "Yes; please scan this qr code at the counter"
      },
      {
        "id": 42,
        "speaker": "D",
        "start": 233.562,
        "end": 235.912,
        "text": "It's showing successful on my side."
      },
      {
        "id": 43,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 237.062,
        "end": 240.846,
        "text": "Received, thank you. Here's your cable and bill."
      },
      {
        "id": 44,
        "speaker": "D",
        "start": 241.39600000000002,
        "end": 242.64600000000002,
        "text": "Great, thanks."
      }
    ],
